{
    desc => q{O opens a new line above and enters insert mode},
    description => <<'END_DESC',
## Macro: `xt/visual/macros/insert_open_O`

Tests that the **O** command opens a new blank line above the current line
and enters insert mode with the cursor on the new line.

**Keys:** `j`, `O`, type `inserted line`, `Escape`

**initial.png**
- Buffer has 2 lines: "line one" and "line two"
- Cursor on line 2 (after pressing `j`)

**after_open_above.png**
- Buffer has 3 lines: "line one", "inserted line", "line two"
- Cursor on line 2 (the new inserted line)
END_DESC
    run => sub {
        my ($ctx) = @_;
        $ctx->buffer->set_text($CODE);
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->keys('j');
        $ctx->delay(50);
        $ctx->snapshot('initial');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->key('O');
        $ctx->type('inserted line');
        $ctx->key('Escape');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('after_open_above');
    },
}
__DATA__
line one
line two
